{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026FShS5kNpeW1793461701.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中環蘭桂坊以外地方都有萬聖節主題的活動，部分人稱，稍後會轉去蘭桂坊。有活動的商戶推出優惠吸客，晚上已賣斷貨。</p><p></p><p>旺角朗豪坊商場派對，吸引不少「嘩鬼」參加，有「鬼小巴」，小狗都來湊熱鬧，布袋笠頭的造型，加上一把刀，夠不夠煞氣呢？有鬼亦有道士驅鬼，不過這樣驅法會否太兒戲？</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN.OTHERS 2300..jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026fX2tI9ydfa1793462434.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN.OTHERS 2300._001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026YDSQXWyrwR1793462516.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>深圳的「老人家」不捨得走，玩夜一些都不怕。</p><p></p><p>深圳旅客黃小姐稱：「皇崗回去，皇崗24小時通關。聽說現在公交都挺多的，應該沒有問題的。聽說蘭桂坊也很好玩。」</p><p></p><p>商場派對活動完結後，不少市民仍留在砵蘭街一帶，慶祝萬聖節。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN.OTHERS 2300._002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026iy0AhRGmYE1793462453.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>一眾另類「酒鬼」就聚集在中環海濱美酒佳餚巡禮，它難得來到地球，當然要飲一杯。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN.OTHERS 2300._004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026pYIqvmwPv61793462474.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>記者問：「你穿成這樣你能喝酒嗎？」</p><p></p><p>台灣旅客柳先生說：「可以，我可以這樣喝。」</p><p></p><p>記者問：「不會不方便嗎？」</p><p></p><p>柳先生回答：「因為我的嘴巴很大。」</p><p></p><p>酒肉和尚都「破戒」。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN.OTHERS 2300._005.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026TKbiYBmNah1793462488.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>蕭先生表示：「化緣，濟公化緣，因為我希望世界和平。」</p><p></p><p>因應萬聖節，活動延長開放至凌晨一時，有商戶指，人流比前幾天多一至三成，推出特別優惠，吸引「餓鬼」消費。美酒佳餚巡禮周日結束。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:35.121501+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":452,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T15:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:17:57.797689+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:26.200753+00:00","content_hash":"91184b17838455025e29a07da4bb6a7a3e913624d2e59f27abbdb164ac67b288","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:35.121501+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}